	)
	(text "Module inserts between track and controller.\nDuring normal forward drive the switch is fully on (low Rds),\nso the module is near-transparent on BLACK (~27-47mV at 40A).\nBrake detection: voltage sense on BLACK, tapped on the TRACK side\n(TRACK_POS) of the switch -> PA1."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45 112 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "a9b707d4-159b-4e32-b58d-8214ffa0a94d")
	)
	(text "J1\nWHITE\ntrack"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 44 38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b4362d00-8768-41b6-9494-843afb82aae1")
	)
	(text "BLACK PATH IS BROKEN HERE BY THE REVERSE SWITCH:\nTrack BLACK (J3) = TRACK_POS. Controller BLACK (J4) = CTRL_BLACK_IN.\nThese are SEPARATE nets — the two N-ch reverse-block switch (sheet 7)\nsits between them. WHITE (J1/J2 = +12V_RAIL) and RED (J5/J6 = GND)\npass straight through; only BLACK is switched."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45 95 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.2 1.2)
				(bold yes)
			)
		)
		(uuid "bbf86806-8439-4ded-8814-26065bc2ee30")
	)
	(text "J3\nBLACK\ntrack"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 44 58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "ee2903eb-6759-48d3-99cd-0d3ccf8199d2")
	)
	(text "SIGNAL DESCRIPTIONS:\nWHITE (+12-16V):  Always-live rail from track PSU (40-90A). Powers module\n                  via F1+LDO. Also powers the TPS1212-Q1 and the anti-brake current source.\nBLACK (track +):  Controlled by hand controller (0 to rail voltage).\n                  Falls to near 0V when controller shorts for braking.\nRED (common -):   Braid return. Common ground reference (GND)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 45 130 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
